<h3><b>How to Participate</b></h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Follow these quick steps to claim your AEON tokens as soon as the event goes live:</span></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Step 1 — Open Binance Wallet: Launch the Binance App and navigate directly to the Binance Wallet section.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Step 2 — Find the Event: Go to Binance Alpha =&gt; Alpha Events and locate the official AEON (AEON) campaign page right when trading opens at 10:00 UTC on July 27, 2026.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Step 3 — Check Your Points: Make sure you meet the minimum threshold of 245 Binance Alpha Points (or the lowered requirement if the point system automatically degrades).</span></li>
