<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">No Spot Guarantee: As with all Binance Alpha assets, AEON is an early-stage listing and is not available on Binance Spot. A future Spot listing is not guaranteed.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Stay Tuned: Keep an eye on Binance’s official channels for further updates leading up to the event.</span></li>
</ul>
<h2><b>What Is AEON?</b></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Crypto payments are finally bridging the gap with real-world commerce. </span><a href="https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/aeon-xyz/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener external noreferrer" data-wpel-link="external"><span style="font-weight: 400;">According to CoinMarketCap</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">, AEON is building a universal crypto settlement layer designed to empower both everyday users and AI agents to pay merchants seamlessly using digital assets.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">By connecting Web3 liquidity with traditional payment rails, AEON makes spending crypto as easy online as it is offline.</span></p>
<h3><b>Solving the Web3 Fragmentation Problem</b></h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Navigating different blockchains, exchanges, and wallets has always been a headache for crypto adoption. AEON aims to solve this exact fragmentation.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The protocol’s infrastructure handles everything behind the scenes:</span></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Smart Payment Routing:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> Finds the most efficient path for transactions.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Instant Asset Conversion:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> Swaps digital assets seamlessly at the point of sale.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Real-time Verification &amp; Settlement:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> Ensures merchants receive funds without friction.</span></li>
</ul>
<h3><b>What is AEON QR Pay?</b></h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">AEON QR Pay integrates directly with major crypto exchanges and wallets. The best part? You don&#8217;t need to lock up your funds or transfer them into a separate AEON account before making a purchase.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Key Highlights:</span></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Global Footprint: Supports crypto payments at over 50 million merchants worldwide.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Key Regions: Deep coverage across emerging markets, including Vietnam, the Philippines, Nigeria, and Brazil.</span></li>
</ul>
<h3><b>Powering the Future of AI-Driven Commerce</b></h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">AEON isn&#8217;t just for human users—it extends its settlement layer directly to autonomous AI agents. Within preset permission limits, AI agents can now pay for goods and services independently, enabling automated workflows such as:</span></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Booking flights and hotels.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Purchasing data feeds.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Accessing paid developer APIs.</span></li>
</ul>
